  "entry_before": {
    "id": "M21",
    "title_zh": "知识与生活：相连的哲学候选",
    "title_en": "Knowing and living: connected philosophical proposal",
    "claim_zh": "认识、纠正与模型修订构成相连候选。G0下，意识分化生的意义而不穷尽其生命范围；进一步的生可有正面意义，无须已有受亏欠者。正面意义、整体比较、许可及特定义务各有公开根据；保留整体依存、未来生活、真实损失与有限完成。",
    "claim_en": "Knowing, correction and model revision form a connected account. Under G0, consciousness differentiates significance without exhausting its living scope; further formation can count positively without an existing deprived claimant. Favorable significance, overall comparison, permission and assigned duty have explicit grounds, preserving whole dependence, future lives, real loss and finite fulfillment.",
    "scope_zh": "两个问题作为G0/J下有辩护的哲学立场完成；保留意识范围对手，新增Frick人口伦理原典比较及七项概念应用。普遍强制接受、整套理论必要性及最广组织范围未证。无新定理、实验或独立验收。继承界面相容8／11、一般相容13／18、模型修订30／72及76次执行、来源26／53、选择性修订16／32与四项统计复核原范围；G0/J不重开，普遍语义与意识仍开放。",
    "scope_en": "Both questions are complete as a defended G0/J position, retaining the conscious-scope rival and adding a primary Frick comparison plus seven conceptual applications. Compulsory universal acceptance, whole-theory necessity and the broadest organizational scope remain unproved. No new theorem, experiment or independent acceptance. Inherited profile compatibility 8/11, general compatibility 13/18, model revision 30/72 and 76 runs, source reliance 26/53, selective revision 16/32 and four-statistic checks retain their scopes; G0/J is not reopened, and universal semantics and consciousness remain open.",
